Package: teffects
Title: An R Version of the Stata Teffects Suite
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kyle", "Butts", , "buttskyle96@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Kyle Butts [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Kyle Butts <buttskyle96@gmail.com>
Description: Implements treatment-effect estimators with an interface modeled on
    Stata's 'teffects' suite. Supports regression adjustment, inverse-probability
    weighting, doubly robust estimators, propensity-score matching, and
    nearest-neighbor matching, inverse probability tilting, and covariate
    balancing propensity scores. Also implements inverse-probability weighted
    regression adjustment, lasso-selected augmented inverse-probability
    weighting with optional cross-fitting, and marginal quantile treatment
    effects. Experimental internal implementations cover normalized kappa
    weighting, covariate balancing, and doubly robust local average treatment
    effects with a binary instrument. Supports binary and multivalued
    treatments. Uses standards-compliant sparse formula expansion, direct
    matrix implementations for estimation and matching.
